WEBVTT

00:01:31.529 --> 00:01:35.199
From that day forward, the world changed.

00:01:35.408 --> 00:01:41.456
A hell where humans and beasts
possessed by demons feast on people.

00:01:41.664 --> 00:01:49.547
My heart, frozen with despair, is only capable
of feeling the taste of bloody meat...

00:01:49.756 --> 00:01:52.842
...and my hatred towards that man.

00:02:31.255 --> 00:02:34.092
Where is he?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:39.972
You have persevered in this darkness
for many years, feeding on Daemons.

00:02:42.642 --> 00:02:49.107
Do you hate him that much, Velvet Crowe?

00:02:49.315 --> 00:02:51.859
Who are you to speak? You are his Malak.

00:02:52.068 --> 00:02:54.320
Where is Artorius?

00:02:54.529 --> 00:02:59.784
You must hurry.
| have broken many Yokes on my way here.

00:03:02.161 --> 00:03:07.750
Any Exorcist would easily notice. If you wish
to leave this place, there is no time to spare.

00:03:56.716 --> 00:03:58.384
Centurion-class Exorcists!

00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:06.726
Out of my way.

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:09.854
You are a Daemoneater.
You cannot defeat an Exorcist.

00:04:36.214 --> 00:04:37.381
Velvet!

00:05:05.451 --> 00:05:06.702
This way.

00:05:09.038 --> 00:05:10.998
Why?!

00:05:11.207 --> 00:05:13.334
What are you doing?

00:05:13.543 --> 00:05:16.462
It's the route you took
by breaking the seals, right?

00:05:16.671 --> 00:05:19.632
I'm not that stupid.

00:05:32.687 --> 00:05:38.943
| thought rushing forward was your
only fighting tactic. It seems I am wrong.

00:05:39.151 --> 00:05:42.280
You mean how I chose to hide in here?

00:05:42.488 --> 00:05:43.573
Yes.

00:05:47.577 --> 00:05:54.792
My only goal is Artorius.
| will use whatever I can to achieve that.

00:05:55.001 --> 00:05:57.169
Useless.

00:05:57.378 --> 00:06:01.674
It seems like this is where they keep
the items confiscated from the Daemons.

00:06:11.642 --> 00:06:16.731
That sword... Is that Stormhowl!? Why is it here?

00:06:16.939 --> 00:06:19.650
It might be too big for me...

00:06:19.859 --> 00:06:24.614
Are you sure?
The Stormhowl is a matchless blade.

00:06:24.822 --> 00:06:29.535
No matter how great,
if I can't use it, it's meaningless.

00:06:29.744 --> 00:06:33.915
During the three years
you have spent locked up in here,

00:06:34.123 --> 00:06:37.877
several events have occurred
that have changed the world.

00:06:38.085 --> 00:06:41.672
Do you not wish to know what happened?

00:06:43.257 --> 00:06:49.597
There are many Exorcists in the world, and they
are organizing a resistance against the Daemons.

00:06:50.806 --> 00:06:51.933
Speak.

00:06:54.018 --> 00:06:56.729
Where is Artorius?

00:06:56.938 --> 00:07:00.900
He is in Lawgress, the capital,
in the Midgand Region.

00:07:04.528 --> 00:07:07.615
There may be an army of Exorcists outside.

00:07:08.741 --> 00:07:14.580
Are you sure you don't want
to know what you saw that night?

00:07:21.921 --> 00:07:23.339
That night...

00:07:23.547 --> 00:07:28.636
When he completed that ritual,
the world changed.

00:07:28.844 --> 00:07:33.391
Many Malakim came to this world,
and the Exorcists that lead them

00:07:33.599 --> 00:07:36.185
put a stop to the invasion of Daemons.

00:07:38.396 --> 00:07:42.525
As the leader of the Abbey,
the organization of Exorcists,

00:07:42.733 --> 00:07:47.488
he has earned the trust of both
the kingdom and its people.

00:07:47.697 --> 00:07:51.784
As a shield for humankind
and the sword that hunts Daemons,

00:07:51.993 --> 00:07:55.663
Artorius Collbrande
is known as their "savior."

00:07:55.871 --> 00:07:59.625
A power he gained by sacrificing a child.

00:07:59.834 --> 00:08:02.962
Yes, but he is not yet complete.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.673
He can still be killed.

00:08:06.507 --> 00:08:09.010
You're one of them, though.

00:08:09.218 --> 00:08:12.346
Seres the Malak.

00:08:12.555 --> 00:08:14.098
Of course.

00:08:14.306 --> 00:08:16.517
Then why?

00:08:16.726 --> 00:08:21.188
| will explain once we leave this place safely.

00:09:12.865 --> 00:09:17.203
Listen to what I have to say! Or else...

00:09:22.458 --> 00:09:23.793
What's so funny?

00:09:24.001 --> 00:09:26.420
You're unlucky.

00:09:26.629 --> 00:09:27.713
What?!

00:09:27.922 --> 00:09:30.091
You're a prison-breaker, aren't you?

00:09:30.299 --> 00:09:31.133
What...

00:09:31.342 --> 00:09:35.596
A prison-breaker, attacking another
prison-breaker by mistake...

00:09:35.805 --> 00:09:38.808
How unlucky can you be?

00:09:39.016 --> 00:09:41.018
So you're...

00:09:41.227 --> 00:09:43.104
A prison-breaker.

00:09:44.855 --> 00:09:51.737
So that's why there were so many
Exorcists crawling around!

00:09:53.781 --> 00:09:56.450
He is... a Daemon!

00:10:00.412 --> 00:10:05.709
| see... You don't seem
like regular humans either.

00:10:07.211 --> 00:10:09.713
Well, let's go.

00:10:09.922 --> 00:10:13.217
There could be an army of Exorcists outside.

00:10:13.425 --> 00:10:17.596
| have to find my partner before I escape.

00:10:17.805 --> 00:10:23.185
| guess I can grab a guard and...

00:10:23.394 --> 00:10:24.603
Is that...?!

00:10:26.313 --> 00:10:27.481
Stormhowl!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.650
That's my partner!

00:10:33.404 --> 00:10:35.197
This is your...

00:10:38.492 --> 00:10:41.412
No, it belongs to me now.

00:10:44.582 --> 00:10:48.711
| don't kid around about Stormhowl.

00:10:48.919 --> 00:10:52.089
Do you want me to try?

00:10:52.298 --> 00:10:53.591
You...!

00:10:55.509 --> 00:11:00.556
One question. Can you use this sword?

00:11:00.764 --> 00:11:03.809
Of course. It's my partner.

00:11:04.018 --> 00:11:06.353
Can you beat Exorcists with it?

00:11:06.562 --> 00:11:12.651
Exorcists? I can beat them with
these dull blades that I took from them.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:19.658
Fine. I will give you Stormhowl,
on one condition.

00:11:19.867 --> 00:11:21.410
Condition?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.374
So what do you want me to do?

00:11:27.583 --> 00:11:29.919
Do you have a ship ready?

00:11:30.127 --> 00:11:33.255
You knew that you were on an island.

00:11:33.464 --> 00:11:37.801
Yes. I know that this is a prison island
for locking up Daemons, too.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:42.348
Some of my meals told me
while begging for their lives.

00:11:42.556 --> 00:11:46.435
There are two ports,
one on each side of the island.

00:11:46.644 --> 00:11:50.356
My ship is on the back side.

00:11:50.564 --> 00:11:54.693
What are the chances that
there are Exorcists waiting there?

00:11:54.902 --> 00:11:59.740
Given the current situation,
we should assume that they are there.

00:11:59.949 --> 00:12:05.579
If I were them, I would send all of the ships
out of the ports to lock us on the island.

00:12:05.788 --> 00:12:09.750
If that happens, there would be
no way off of this island.

00:12:11.627 --> 00:12:14.630
Then what should we do?

00:12:14.838 --> 00:12:21.679
| say whittle down their forces to make it
easier for me to take a ship by force.

00:12:23.681 --> 00:12:27.184
And that's where my partner and I come in.

00:12:31.438 --> 00:12:36.110
| don't know much about this prison.

00:12:36.318 --> 00:12:38.988
| just know about the
underground layer that I was in,

00:12:39.196 --> 00:12:43.993
and that there are approximately
one thousand Daemons in the layer above me.

00:12:44.201 --> 00:12:46.161
How did you learn this?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:51.834
Do you want to hear how many Daemons
| had to eat each day?

00:12:54.211 --> 00:12:58.924
This layer is for solitary confinement--
That we know from what you two told me.

00:12:59.133 --> 00:13:05.014
Then I can release the prisoners
and create chaos.

00:13:06.807 --> 00:13:10.644
They would not have the chance
to make the ships leave port.

00:13:10.853 --> 00:13:12.021
Do you understand?

00:13:12.229 --> 00:13:13.314
Yes.

00:13:15.983 --> 00:13:20.404
Now, you must disperse and whittle down
the enemy forces as much as possible.

00:13:20.612 --> 00:13:22.781
I'm a man of my word.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.076
You seem like the type to fit in with chaos.

00:13:26.285 --> 00:13:27.578
Hmph.

00:13:39.006 --> 00:13:40.257
He's strong...

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:48.349
Nicked already? This really is a dull blade.

00:13:49.391 --> 00:13:53.562
I'm ready, go ahead.

00:13:53.771 --> 00:13:55.105
Seres!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.795
Turn right at the end of this corridor.

00:14:18.003 --> 00:14:20.923
That's the route to the upper floor.

00:14:21.131 --> 00:14:23.175
Thanks for this.

00:14:36.688 --> 00:14:38.399
Yeehaw!

00:14:57.084 --> 00:14:58.794
We must turn back.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:05.384
Your powers are limited to eating,
as a Daemoneater.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:10.764
They will not allow you to survive this fall.

00:15:22.609 --> 00:15:24.236
They are faster than I thought.

00:15:26.113 --> 00:15:29.950
They are Exorcists as well.
| cannot hold them for long!

00:15:41.128 --> 00:15:44.214
It's not as high as the shrine
he got dropped in.

00:16:38.685 --> 00:16:41.772
You would go that far...?

00:17:14.721 --> 00:17:19.351
You are strong. It is as if you have a Contract.

00:17:20.686 --> 00:17:22.187
A Contract?

00:17:22.396 --> 00:17:28.443
It is a ritual that places
a limitation on one's own words.

00:17:28.652 --> 00:17:34.074
It grants a special power. The stronger
the limitation, the stronger the power.

00:17:34.283 --> 00:17:36.827
It is somewhat like a...

00:17:37.035 --> 00:17:38.787
A curse.

00:17:41.123 --> 00:17:42.624
Let's go.

00:17:59.349 --> 00:18:04.104
That flag... It is the sign
of a Praetor-class Exorcist.

00:18:04.313 --> 00:18:07.983
So on that ship must be...

00:18:08.191 --> 00:18:12.696
Artorius, would you go that far...?

00:18:14.406 --> 00:18:20.245
Your voyage and mine
have now become more difficult.

00:18:20.454 --> 00:18:25.459
The Praetor-class Exorcists are incomparably
more powerful than the Centurions.

00:18:27.169 --> 00:18:31.381
Will you still fight, knowing this?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.759
Obviously.

00:18:43.894 --> 00:18:47.522
The emotions that he stirred within you...

00:18:47.731 --> 00:18:55.280
Will that create hope for this world
or spread malevolence?

00:18:57.199 --> 00:19:00.535
That will cross in the future.

00:19:00.827 --> 00:19:05.290
"Chapter 5 - The Dawn of Chaos"

00:22:51.099 --> 00:22:54.686
"Next episode preview"

00:22:55.353 --> 00:22:59.065
No road is long with good company.
Travel is harsh and difficult.

00:22:59.274 --> 00:23:03.320
It's no coincidence that we met.
Let's stay friendly until we get out of here.

00:23:03.528 --> 00:23:04.821
| have no intention of making friends.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:10.493
How cold. Once we get off of this island,
I'll buy you a good drink.

00:23:11.328 --> 00:23:12.662
You're gonna ignore me?!

00:23:12.871 --> 00:23:16.958
We will be facing a Praetor-class Exorcist now.
We must be prepared.

00:23:17.167 --> 00:23:18.043
Yeah, yeah.

00:23:18.251 --> 00:23:24.424
Praetors are of no concern to me.
My goal is to defeat Artorius.

00:23:24.633 --> 00:23:25.884
| will have my revenge!

00:23:26.092 --> 00:23:27.093
That's the spirit!

00:23:27.302 --> 00:23:30.472
I'll help however I can.
Let's all get out of here!

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:31.222
Yes.

00:23:31.431 --> 00:23:35.936
Yes. Next week, "Velvet Crowe."
Look forward to it!

00:23:36.144 --> 00:23:37.896
So it's just gonna be about you?

00:23:38.104 --> 00:23:38.980
But you're curious, aren't you?

00:23:39.189 --> 00:23:45.278
I'd bet the dramatic life story of
Rokurou Rangetsu is much more interesting!

00:23:45.487 --> 00:23:50.909
Oh, such a tear-inducing dramatic story...
